      "index": 1,
      "id": "8016295250252517441_77765",
      "question": "Following Hitler's suicide, this admiral served for nearly a month as president of Germany in a government with Chancellor Goebbels .\nThe creator of the \"wolfpack\" tactics used by U-Boats, for the point, who was this Nazi admiral, the Supreme Commander of the German Navy during World War Two?",
